==Battleground==
*1 [[Zangief (Enemy)|Zangief]] spawns as the boss.
*3 [[Teacher Bear]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This is not difficult at all. It is no more than a hard or veteran stage. [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]], [[Bath Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Sexy Bathtub Cat]], and [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cat]] are very good at taking out Zangief. Your loadout should be focused on defeating Zangief, as the Teacher Bears have low magnification and are thus easy to defeat.

